{"words": [{"t": 0.086958, "d": 0.130416, "w": "One"}, {"t": 0.22825, "d": 0.347833, "w": "detail"}, {"t": 0.586958, "d": 0.217375, "w": "about"}, {"t": 0.815208, "d": 0.445666, "w": "PyTorch"}, {"t": 1.27175, "d": 0.25, "w": "here"}, {"t": 1.891291, "d": 0.054333, "w": "The"}, {"t": 1.956541, "d": 0.27175, "w": "model"}, {"t": 2.239125, "d": 0.391291, "w": "itself"}, {"t": 2.706541, "d": 0.315208, "w": "only"}, {"t": 3.032625, "d": 0.434791, "w": "outputs"}, {"t": 3.47825, "d": 0.532625, "w": "logits"}, {"t": 4.152166, "d": 0.108708, "w": "and"}, {"t": 4.27175, "d": 0.608708, "w": "PyTorch's"}, {"t": 4.891291, "d": 0.630416, "w": "cross-entropy"}, {"t": 5.532625, "d": 0.326083, "w": "loss"}, {"t": 5.869583, "d": 0.358708, "w": "applies"}, {"t": 6.239125, "d": 0.739125, "w": "log-softmax"}, {"t": 6.989125, "d": 0.489125, "w": "internally"}, {"t": 7.739125, "d": 0.163041, "w": "so"}, {"t": 7.913041, "d": 0.576083, "w": "softmax"}, {"t": 8.554333, "d": 0.130416, "w": "is"}, {"t": 8.695666, "d": 0.22825, "w": "just"}, {"t": 8.934791, "d": 0.119583, "w": "how"}, {"t": 9.065208, "d": 0.130416, "w": "we"}, {"t": 9.206541, "d": 0.184791, "w": "read"}, {"t": 9.402166, "d": 0.086958, "w": "the"}, {"t": 9.5, "d": 0.510875, "w": "outputs"}, {"t": 10.347833, "d": 0.065208, "w": "it"}, {"t": 10.423916, "d": 0.22825, "w": "isn't"}, {"t": 10.663041, "d": 0.130416, "w": "an"}, {"t": 10.869583, "d": 0.293458, "w": "extra"}, {"t": 11.173916, "d": 0.326083, "w": "layer"}, {"t": 11.510875, "d": 0.054333, "w": "in"}, {"t": 11.576083, "d": 0.054333, "w": "the"}, {"t": 11.641291, "d": 0.336958, "w": "model"}], "duration": 12.312708333333333, "spoken": "One detail about PyTorch here. The model itself only outputs logits, and PyTorch's cross-entropy loss applies log-softmax internally, so softmax is just how we read the outputs, it isn't an extra layer in the model."}